---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Uppe. | Keep your services in view">
<main><a class="brand" href="/">Uppe<span>.</span></a><p class="eyebrow">SERVICE MONITORING, ON YOUR TERMS</p><h1>Know when your<br/>services need you.</h1><p class="intro">Monitor websites and TCP services from your own node. Keep a record of each check, and share availability through a public status page.</p><a class="open" href="/dashboard">Open your dashboard <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><div class="features"><section><span>01</span><h2>Make every check count.</h2><p>See recent responses and uptime history for the services you depend on.</p></section><section><span>02</span><h2>Keep people informed.</h2><p>Choose which services to publish. Your internal targets stay in your dashboard.</p></section><section><span>03</span><h2>Run it yourself.</h2><p>Your node stores your monitoring history and signs its audit records.</p></section></div><footer>Uppe. <span>Monitoring that doesn't let you down.</span></footer></main>
</Layout>
<style>main{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:48px 28px;color:#e0def4}.brand{font-size:34px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-2px}.brand span{color:#c4a7e7}.eyebrow{margin-top:100px;color:#c4a7e7;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px}h1{font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,80px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-3px;line-height:1.06;margin:22px 0}.intro{max-width:590px;color:#a7a2bb;font-size:18px;line-height:1.8}.open{display:inline-flex;gap:28px;background:#c4a7e7;color:#232033;border-radius:8px;padding:15px 22px;margin-top:32px;font-weight:600}.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px;margin:90px 0 70px;padding-top:30px;border-top:1px solid #393552}.features span{font-size:12px;color:#c4a7e7}h2{font-size:18px;margin:20px 0 10px}.features p,footer{color:#a7a2bb;line-height:1.7;font-size:14px}footer{border-top:1px solid #393552;padding-top:25px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}@media(max-width:650px){.features{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}.eyebrow{margin-top:65px}footer{gap:20px}}</style>
